{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/LEAOQU1TA8WCxyxE5Idftg","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:59:13.366305+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/LEAOQU1TA8WCxyxE5Idftg","html":"<div><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/LibQHNHIKUnRwylpGuCGmTrwnLvvpzTH7S8ib6JZibBgLt0gAsRmw40IbweL78j7JiaITTiaQROySU697jeBFf9DL6Q/640?wx_fmt=gif\"/></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/LibQHNHIKUnTuHB8gmnzS2YPGCBU24Tf1g6DXz8vN8icKNGk37p5WOUDv8DRnazhialia3yiamPCWLYhABpvF69iaLEg/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>香港中文大学（深圳）理工学院全日制理学硕士（Master of Science Programs）“工创未来 · 2025年全国优秀大学生夏令营” 已正式开放申请。</span></span></strong><span><span>本次夏令营旨在</span></span><span><span>增进同学们对港中大（深圳）理工学院全日制理学硕士项目的了解，体验国际化教学模式与前沿科研氛围，并提前选拔2026级全日制理学硕士研究生。</span></span></p></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><b><span>夏令营介绍</span></b></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>PART 1</span></span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>本次夏令营涵盖学术讲座、师生交流、项目介绍等活动，并安排2026级提前批次入学考核。夏令营营员将有机会被提前录取，优秀营员将获得丰厚的入学奖学金。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>开放申请的全日制理学硕士项目包括：</span><strong><span>通信工程</span></strong><span>、</span><strong><span>计算机与信息工程</span></strong><span>、</span><strong><span>人工智能与机器人</span></strong><span>、</span><strong><span>集成电路与系统</span></strong><span>及</span><strong><span>金融数学</span></strong><span>。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><strong><span>报名时间</span></strong><span>：</span></span><span><span>2025年5月30日00:00-6月30日23:59</span></span></p><p><strong><span>活动时间：</span></strong><span>2025年7月23日-7月25日</span><span><br/></span><strong><span>活动地点：</span></strong><span>线上</span></p><p><strong><span>招收对象：</span></strong><span>大学本科三年级学生（2026年应届毕业生）</span></p></section></section><section><section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>报名须知</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>PART 2</span></span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>01</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><strong><span>报名条件</span></strong><strong></strong><span><span>| Application Requirements </span></span></span></p></section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>1. 大学本科三年级学生（2026年应届毕业生）；</span></p><p><span>2. 平均成绩不低于“B”等级。</span></p></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>02</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><strong><span>报名流程</span></strong><strong></strong><span><span>| Application Process</span></span></span></p></section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>1. 报名时间：</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>2025年5月30日00:00-6月30日23:59。</span></strong></p><p><span>请在截止时间前通过港中大（深圳）“研究生课程申请系统”报名，请务必认真填写及上传相关附件。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><strong><span>2. 报名网址：</span></strong></p><p><span><strong><span>https://pgapply.cuhk.edu.cn</span></strong></span></p><p><span>选择:</span></p></section></section><section><section><ul><li><p><span>通信工程（AY2026-27 夏令营）</span></p></li><li><p><span>计算机与信息工程（AY2026-27 夏令营）</span></p></li><li><p><span>人工智能与机器人（AY2026-27 夏令营）</span></p></li><li><p><span>集成电路与系统（AY2026-27 夏令营）</span></p></li><li><p><span>金融数学（AY2026-27 夏令营）</span></p></li></ul></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>3. 报名材料：</span></strong></p><p><span>申请者需选择意向项目的报名入口，并上传：</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><strong><span>(1) 个人简历（英文）</span></strong></p><p><strong><span><br/></span></strong></p><p><strong><span>(2) 个人陈述（英文）</span></strong></p><p><strong><span><br/></span></strong></p><p><strong><span>(3) 学业成绩单（本科前2年或前5个学期）</span></strong></p><p><span>申请者需上传由官方开具且加盖公章的完整成绩单及绩点计算说明原件扫描件。若成绩单上无平均绩点或者无均分体现，请同时上传一份由官方开具的平均分证明（百分制加权平均分/CGPA均可）。</span></p><p><em><span>*</span><span><span>请将以上文件合并为一份PDF上传。</span></span></em></p><p><span><em><span><br/></span></em></span></p><p><strong><span>(4) 在读证明</span></strong></p><p><span>需加盖大学/学院教务处或相关校级部门公章。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><strong><span>(5) 英语能力资格证书</span></strong></p><p><span>如英语四级、六级、托福、雅思、GMAT等。</span><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><strong><span>(6) 推荐信</span></strong></p><p><span>至少两封，需含推荐人签字或签章。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><strong><span>(7) 身份证彩色正反面扫描件</span></strong></p><p><span>扫描在一张A4纸上。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><strong><span>(8) 其他证明材料</span></strong></p><p><span>已发表的论文复印件、奖状复印件、各类证书复印件等。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><strong><span>4. 报名费用：</span></strong></p><p><span>本次夏令营免除报名费。</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>03</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><strong><span>注意事项 </span></strong><span><span>| Notes</span></span></span></p></section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>1.注册研究生课程申请系统时，申请人保证填报信息、上传材料的真实性和准确性。若发现提供虚假信息，一经核实申请资格将被立即取消；    </span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>2.申请信息填报完毕后请认真确认，确认无误后，点击确认并提交，提交后不可更改信息；</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>3.申请成功后将生成申请编码，请妥善留存。理工学院全日制理学硕士项目评审委员会对申请者的教育背景进行综合评估与筛选后，将在2-3周内与成功申请的学生联系，未入选者，将不另行通知。</span></p></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>项目介绍</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>PART 3</span></span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>01</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><strong><span>项目简介</span></strong><strong></strong><span><span>| Programs Introduction</span></span></span></p></section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/iagk1ibLIibBWzXsnKNov8klI5s2NOt25Gd5jdHkrBy7R94eGMy4tibde2ibdtyzoNPydlMsbicbWhxK9zVU4ZIqLUBg/640?wx_fmt=gif\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>01</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>通信工程理学硕士项目</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>通信工程理学硕士项目，Master of Science in Communications Engineering（简称MSc. CE）是围绕通信工程领域开设的为期两年的全日制硕士项目。项目涵盖网络智能、下一代通信网络、无线通信、机器学习、物联网、云计算、边缘计算、大数据系统和分析处理等多种新兴热门技术领域知识，同时在每个学期均设立循序渐进的研究项目，引导学生将专业知识娴熟应用于科学研究和实践当中，充分发挥自主能动性与创新思维。毕业生将成为兼具行业理论与实践的专业型复合人才，以开拓的国际视野和扎实的实操技能快速适应瞬息万变的行业形势与市场需求。</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/iagk1ibLIibBWzXsnKNov8klI5s2NOt25Gd5jdHkrBy7R94eGMy4tibde2ibdtyzoNPydlMsbicbWhxK9zVU4ZIqLUBg/640?wx_fmt=gif\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>02</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>计算机与信息工程理学硕士项目</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>计算机与信息工程理学硕士项目，Master of Science in Computer and Information Engineering（简称MSc. CIE）是围绕计算机科学和信息工程技术领域开设的为期两年的全日制硕士项目，旨在培养计算机与信息工程相关领域的专业应用型人才。项目课程紧密结合全球计算机人工智能迅猛发展的潮流，涵盖计算机科学和信息工程领域内的基础理论知识与前沿技术，包括人工智能、AI芯片及应用、计算机科学、机器学习、区块链及元宇宙等，并将相关理论与现实应用有效结合，致力于培养具备扎实理论基础、卓越创新能力和国际竞争力的高素质专业人才，以满足粤港澳大湾区乃至全球对计算机与信息工程领域专业人才的迫切需求。</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/iagk1ibLIibBWzXsnKNov8klI5s2NOt25Gd5jdHkrBy7R94eGMy4tibde2ibdtyzoNPydlMsbicbWhxK9zVU4ZIqLUBg/640?wx_fmt=gif\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>03</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>人工智能与机器人理学硕士项目</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>人工智能与机器人理学硕士项目，Master of Science in Artificial Intelligence and Robotics（简称MSc. AIR）由香港中文大学（深圳）理工学院和数据科学学院共同开设。学制为两年，并提供两个细分方向供学生选择：人工智能和机器人。项目依托港中大（深圳）理工学院、数据科学学院及深圳市人工智能与机器人研究院的优秀师资和科研力量，旨在培养人工智能与机器人领域的尖端人才。学生将掌握计算机科学、人工智能和机器人领域的基本理论，并在机器学习、计算机视觉、自然语言处理、机器人、自动化、智能系统和人机交互等领域深入学习。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>毕业前，学生将有机会参与到实际研究课题项目中，包括与海外知名大学、国内知名企业合作，提高实践技能和解决问题的能力，为未来深造或就业做好充足准备。毕业后，学生将成为人工智能和机器人领域的专业人才，为粤港澳大湾区和整个国家信息技术快速发展助力。</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/iagk1ibLIibBWzXsnKNov8klI5s2NOt25Gd5jdHkrBy7R94eGMy4tibde2ibdtyzoNPydlMsbicbWhxK9zVU4ZIqLUBg/640?wx_fmt=gif\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>04</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>集成电路与系统理学硕士项目</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>集成电路与系统理学硕士项目，Master of Science in Integrated Circuits and Systems（简称MSc. ICS）是围绕集成电路领域开设的为期两年的全日制硕士项目，旨在满足粤港澳大湾区乃至全国对集成电路产业专业型人才的需求。项目课程涵盖半导体物理和集成电路基础知识，并开设了围绕通讯集成电路设计、测量实验和微纳加工技术为主的实践教学课程，旨在培养学生电子器件设计、芯片设计、设计自动化、制造封装和测试的必要的知识和技能。</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/iagk1ibLIibBWzXsnKNov8klI5s2NOt25Gd5jdHkrBy7R94eGMy4tibde2ibdtyzoNPydlMsbicbWhxK9zVU4ZIqLUBg/640?wx_fmt=gif\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>05</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>金融数学理学硕士项目</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>金融数学理学硕士项目，Master of Science in Financial Mathematics（简称MSc. FMA）是围绕金融数学领域开设的为期两年的全日制硕士项目，旨在培养具有金融理论基础和高级数学应用能力的专业型复合人才。项目课程涵盖金融数学相关的核心知识和方法，旨在培养同学们运用量化分析、数学建模和数据驱动等方法解决金融问题的能力。毕业生预期将掌握量化投资、算法交易、风险管理等金融核心知识，深入学习应用数学相关的专业知识，如：高等数值方法、高等概率理论与数理统计、随机与偏微分方程、高等精算学等。除此之外，同学们还将接触到计算机技术相关的基础理论知识和技术方法，如机器学习、人工智能、金融科技等。课程设计强调跨学科的知识融合和技能训练，并提供多种研究和实践机会。</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>*向上滑动查看详细资料</span></p><p><strong><span>项目详情可查看：</span></strong><strong><span>https://sse.cuhk.edu.cn/Masterprogrammes</span></strong></p></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>02</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><strong><span>培养模式</span></strong><strong></strong><span><span>| Training Mode </span></span></span></p></section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>▲学习模式：全日制</span></p><p><span>▲学习语言：全英文</span></p><p><span>▲学习周期：两年，最长不超过三年</span></p><p><span>▲学分要求：在两学年中修满39学分（其中含“国情教育”课程3学分，国际生无需修读）</span></p><p><span>▲学位授予：香港中文大学理学硕士学位</span></p></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><b><span>学院简介</span></b></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>PART 4</span></span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>香港中文大学（深圳）理工学院成立于2015年，秉承香港中文大学的优秀人文传统和浓厚学术底蕴，致力于培养具有国际视野、中华传统和社会责任感的创新型高层次理工人才。作为香港中文大学（深圳）的始创学院之一，理工学院以发展的眼光，开设了7个本科专业、6个理学硕士项目和7个研究型硕博项目。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>依托香港中文大学卓越的办学理念与完善的学术体系，学院汇聚了来自全球的优秀师资团队，培养了多届的杰出毕业生，为社会输送了大量的高素质理工人才。</span></p></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><b><span>大学简介</span></b></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>PART 5</span></span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/LibQHNHIKUnTuHB8gmnzS2YPGCBU24Tf13BdAd99U592tUvgSbibyD5TjZzShvpia3lE4icX4DnVK3iaftSGric4z3Tw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section><section><section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><p><span>香港中文大学（深圳）是一所经教育部批准，参照中外合作办学条例设立的大学。大学传承香港中文大学的办学理念、优良学术传统，以“结合传统与现代，融会中国与西方”为使命，以创建一所立足中国、面向世界的一流研究型大学为已任，致力于培养具有国际视野、中华传统和社会担当的创新型高层次人才。大学的办学特色包括国际化的氛围、中英并重的教学环境、书院制传统、通识教育、新兴交叉学科设置和以学生为本的育人理念。目前，来自世界各地的10000多名优秀学子正在港中大（深圳）求学。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>梧桐树下听凤鸣，神仙湖畔论古今。这是一个探索学术前沿、规划深造路径的宝贵机会，期待各位优秀学子的加入，在香港中文大学（深圳）理工学院开启一段精彩纷呈、满载收获的学习之旅！</span></p></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>联系我们</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>咨询电话：</span></strong></p><p><span>0755-8427 3971</span></p><p><span>0755-8427 3970</span></p><p><strong><span>邮箱：</span></strong><span>sse-tpg@cuhk.edu.cn</span></p><p><strong><span>地址：</span></strong><span>广东省深圳市龙岗区龙翔大道2001号香港中文大学（深圳）TD-C501</span></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/LibQHNHIKUnTuHB8gmnzS2YPGCBU24Tf17g3OP2FOiamPdZTRY7k5MEezI5QO07yGpDmV6jYTdQ9OesL2sF4ogBA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section><section><p><strong><span>招生咨询群：204310627</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><